    {
      "id": "lEQa",
      "code_hash": "dba453dbfeb6c87436fe7f62d8fb7b8f",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"1-fit\">1. Fit</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Hand-picked model zoo instead of a preset, so the run is short and the baselines are explicit:</span>\n<ul>\n<li>Baselines: <code>Naive</code>, <code>SeasonalNaive</code> (m=48).</li>\n<li>Challengers: <code>DirectTabular</code> and <code>RecursiveTabular</code> (gradient boosting on lags, pooled over all assets),\n  <code>ETS</code> and <code>Theta</code> with <code>seasonal_period=48</code>, plus the <code>WeightedEnsemble</code> AutoGluon builds on top.</li>\n<li><code>eval_metric=\"MASE\"</code> with <code>eval_metric_seasonal_period=48</code> makes model selection and ensemble weights\n  optimise against the seasonal-naive scale.</li>\n</ul></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
